# Leave NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL unset (or localhost) for same-origin /api + /media via Next rewrites.
# Works on localhost, LAN IP, and mobile. Never point the browser at another device's localhost.
#
# Production — if frontend and API share one domain (nginx reverse proxy): leave unset.
# Production — if API is a separate host:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.mohammadiig.ir/api
#
# Optional Nest target for rewrites/SSR (default http://127.0.0.1:3001/api):
# API_INTERNAL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3001/api
